    "caterpillars"
   ],
   "start": 10.805,
   "end": 12.14,
   "show": 10.765,
   "hide": 12.49
  },
  {
   "text": "And that's exactly what the parasite wants.",
   "emph": [
    "wants"
   ],
   "start": 12.53,
   "end": 14.79,
   "show": 12.49,
   "hide": 15.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Because when a bird spots one",
