    "bird"
   ],
   "start": 15.18,
   "end": 16.5,
   "show": 15.14,
   "hide": 16.465
  },
  {
   "text": "and eats it,",
   "emph": [
    "eats"
   ],
   "start": 16.505,
   "end": 17.01,
   "show": 16.465,
   "hide": 17.26
  },
  {
   "text": "the parasite gets inside the bird.",
   "emph": [
    "bird"
   ],
   "start": 17.3,
   "end": 19.26,
   "show": 17.26,
   "hide": 19.81
  },
  {
   "text": "Then its eggs spread",
